{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An arcade driving game that\u2019s all about chaos, speed, and pure fun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Modes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Street Racing</strong>: Race on streets with traffic and people to hit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219800/extras/Race.gif?t=1749103199\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Death Race</strong>: Hit people and make check points to increase your score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Alien Chase</strong>: Don't die or get abducted</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219800/extras/Alien.gif?t=1749103199\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Free Drive</strong>: Just drive</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Open World (64km\u00b2)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>50+ Vehicles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219800/extras/CarChoice.gif?t=1749103199\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Destructive Driving</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgradeable Cars</strong>: Customize with performance and visual upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219800/extras/ChangeCarFast.gif?t=1749103199\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Surface-Based Traction</strong>: Surface and tire affect grip</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219800/extras/SurfaceTraction.gif?t=1749103199\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Day-Night Cycle &amp; Weather System</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Online Radio</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Steering Wheel Support</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Graphics Options</strong>: Use cell shaded or outlined graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219800/extras/ColorChangedCombined.gif?t=1749103199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219800/extras/OutlineTruck.gif?t=1749103199\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Power Ups:</strong> Like unlimited nos on a timer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Online Leaderboards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Four Camera Options</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219800/extras/CameraChanger.gif?t=1749103199\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In Active Development:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Suggest a mode or idea\u2014your input could help the future of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>AI Content Disclosure</strong>: This game includes music and loading screen images that were generated using AI tools.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3219800?t=1749103199","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219800/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749103199","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219800/614984e52483ab71cd919e0f3ce039249240d0c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749103199","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic